<title>FRANCE: Sligos suspended limit up, requote 0925.</title>
<headline>Sligos suspended limit up, requote 0925.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>French computer service company Sligos was suspended limit up on Thursday morning after requoting for the first time since Axime said it would bid for the company.</p>
<p>The French stock markets association SBF said the share would requote at 0925 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
